### Source: gazette_2026_0.pdf
Clause 6(A): (A) Any aggrieved applicant against the allotment of FPS may file an appeal before the Commissionerwithin thirty days of communication of the decision, which shall be disposed of by the Commissioner by a reasoned order within forty-five days from the date of filing of appeal. The decision of the Commissioner shall be final and binding.
## escalation procedure
### Source: citizen_charter_2017.pdf
Clause page 7: Complaints against the PDS outlets regarding measurement, quality, excess charging or refusal to issue commodities, black marketing, can be made to the followings :-
1. Toll Free Number 1967 / 1800 11 0841
